meta_reviews.text:
The authors answered the reviewer’s concerns appropriately, in particular: 
1/ Adding a testing with GPT to mitigate the circularity constraint raised by R1 and R3 ; 
2/ Added template evaluation by two independent radiologists for clinical relevance ; 
3/ Extended the open-source code with additional modality templates.
Therefore, given the relevance of this work to the community, I recommand acceptance.

