reviews.text_detailed_comments:
1.Please furthen review the paper. There are a few typos. 
p.5: “f_age isa two-layer MLP”, might be a typo;
Fig. 2(c): KW p = 7.5e-04 is shown in the figure but reported as 4.1e-3 in text;
The baseline methods, LSOR, LNE and LSSL just pops out without the full name.

The paper addresses a real gap with a reasonable architectural recipe, the experiments are organized sensibly, and the latent-space visualizations are convincing for the healthy training data. However, the weaknessnes mentioned about limit my enthusiasm.

