reviews.text_post_rebuttal_justification:
The rebuttal addressed most of my concerns I will raise the score to 4.
Details;
The authors gave a careful and robust rebuttal in response to the question I raised. Most of the confusions have been settled, including how the pre-ICP alignment works, how the canonical space is built, and several issues regarding to the experiment results. These clarifications successfully differentiate the author’s innovations from incremental developments from previous methods or mere overclaiming, thus I would like to accept the paper.

